        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<div class="image" data-v-adbaae8b=""><img data-nuxt-img="" srcset="https://res.cloudinary.com/about-gitlab-com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,c_lfill/v1780996524/sd1vpl8empy26wizarqj.png 1x, https://res.cloudinary.com/about-gitlab-com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,c_lfill/v1780996524/sd1vpl8empy26wizarqj.png 2x" onerror="this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)" fetch-priority="high" loading="eager" alt="" src="https://res.cloudinary.com/about-gitlab-com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,c_lfill/v1780996524/sd1vpl8empy26wizarqj.png" data-v-adbaae8b=""></div><h2 class="sr-only" data-v-adbaae8b="">Featured post</h2><div class="text" data-v-adbaae8b=""><h3 class="slp-text-heading4-bold" data-v-64ad2128="" data-v-adbaae8b=""><!--[-->GitLab Orbit: Find vulnerability blast radius without the manual hunt<!--]--><!----></h3><p class="slp-text-heading5" data-v-64ad2128="" data-v-adbaae8b=""><!--[-->Exploitation happens at machine speed now. Map every project, owner, and pipeline a critical CVE touches so remediation can keep up.<!--]--><!----></p><span class="slp-text-body3-bold author" data-v-64ad2128="" data-v-adbaae8b=""><!--[-->Author: Rebecca Carter<!--]--><!----></span><a class="cta slp-mt-16 slp-btn slp-btn-primary cta slp-mt-16" data-ga-name="gitlab orbit: find vulnerability blast radius without the manual hunt" data-ga-location="body" href="/blog/find-vulnerability-blast-radius-with-gitlab-orbit/" data-v-c6fd7cb9="" data-v-adbaae8b=""><!--[-->Read Post<!--]--></a></div>]]></content>
