        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<a href="/blog/categories/security/" data-ga-name="security" data-ga-location="post-card" data-v-c154cc84=""><span class="slp-text-body1" data-v-64ad2128="" data-v-c154cc84=""><!--[-->Security<!--]--><!----></span></a><a href="/blog/security-at-machine-speed/" class="card-body" data-ga-name="what happens when vulnerabilities are discovered faster than you can fix them?" data-ga-location="post-card" data-v-c154cc84=""><img width="318" data-nuxt-img="" srcset="https://res.cloudinary.com/about-gitlab-com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_318,c_lfill/v1772195014/ooezwusxjl1f7ijfmbvj.png 1x, https://res.cloudinary.com/about-gitlab-com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_636,c_lfill/v1772195014/ooezwusxjl1f7ijfmbvj.png 2x" onerror="this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)" loading="lazy" alt="" src="https://res.cloudinary.com/about-gitlab-com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_318,c_lfill/v1772195014/ooezwusxjl1f7ijfmbvj.png" data-v-c154cc84=""><h3 class="slp-text-heading5-bold" data-v-64ad2128="" data-v-c154cc84=""><!--[-->What happens when vulnerabilities are discovered faster than you can fix them?<!--]--><!----></h3><p class="slp-text-body1" data-v-64ad2128="" data-v-c154cc84=""><!--[-->Frontier AI is changing how quickly vulnerabilities can be discovered and exploited. The next challenge is bringing that same speed to remediation and prevention, inside the software factory.<!--]--><!----></p></a>]]></content>
